[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10562.309, "timestamp": "02:56:02", "text": "按你的意愿来。我希望如此。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10565.349, "timestamp": "02:56:05", "text": "我也希望如此。我不知道。在最后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10567.03, "timestamp": "02:56:07", "text": "至于当天的情况，我不太清楚你当时的情况。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10569.429, "timestamp": "02:56:09", "text": "一位客户，但至少是基于……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10571.83, "timestamp": "02:56:11", "text": "无论我们之间有过怎样的互动，我确信"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10574.15, "timestamp": "02:56:14", "text": "你表现很棒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10576.15, "timestamp": "02:56:16", "text": "不。是的，我想他们是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10578.79, "timestamp": "02:56:18", "text": "感激。我认为他们确实提到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10582.469, "timestamp": "02:56:22", "text": "消息中提到了这一点。嗯，不过，是的，就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10585.67, "timestamp": "02:56:25", "text": "就像有一段很长的交流，呃，更多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10588.71, "timestamp": "02:56:28", "text": "间隔很长。这件事已经办妥了。你是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10591.269, "timestamp": "02:56:31", "text": "观看是最新迭代，就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10593.83, "timestamp": "02:56:33", "text": "就像现场电视直播时做了一些调整一样，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10596.71, "timestamp": "02:56:36", "text": "分离之类的。所以最初"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10599.429, "timestamp": "02:56:39", "text": "其中一件是去年我生日那天完成的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10603.99, "timestamp": "02:56:43", "text": "8月11日。我12号收到的。是的。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10606.87, "timestamp": "02:56:46", "text": "决不。什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10609.429, "timestamp": "02:56:49", "text": "是的，这几乎已经是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10611.429, "timestamp": "02:56:51", "text": "大概是一年左右吧。但周围"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10614.71, "timestamp": "02:56:54", "text": "这一次，已经进入最后阶段了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10617.99, "timestamp": "02:56:57", "text": "呃，六月、七月，对吧？是的。事情是"}]